# Audiment — SEO, AEO & GEO Implementation Plan

> **Reference:** `_docs/seo_aeo_guide.md` (Final CTO v2)
> **Based on site audit of:** `src/app/` as of May 2026
> **Rule:** No hallucination. No new categories. No enterprise jargon. No repositioning.

---

## What the guide establishes (non-negotiable)

Before any work begins, these two sentences must be treated as locked:

> **Positioning:** Audiment helps multi-location businesses stay on top of quality and compliance across locations.
>
> **Category:** Audiment is audit and inspection software for multi-location businesses.

Every page, every metadata field, every FAQ answer, every schema block must reinforce this — and nothing else.

---

