- [ ] LinkedIn description updated to canonical positioning
- [ ] YouTube descriptions updated
- [ ] 5+ thought leadership blog posts published
- [ ] Concept chain content present on homepage + platform page
- [ ] AI-search FAQ audit: all FAQ answers are direct, first-sentence answers
- [ ] Topical expansion pages scoped (not necessarily built yet)

